      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 584,
        "content": "## 🩺 Silent Churn Radar — Customer Health & Save-Play OS\n\nDetects at-risk paying customers BEFORE they cancel, scores churn risk with AI, and auto-fires a personalized save-play email.\n\n**Flow:** Signal in → Normalize → AI Score → Shape → log to DataTable + route by risk → email.\n\n### Setup (3 steps)\n1. Connect **Anthropic** + **Gmail** credentials.\n2. Data Table `customer_health_log` is already created for this workflow.\n3. Activate + POST customer signals to the webhook (payload sample on the left)."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "bd7176f0-2ce7-4141-96b1-ed102dd62fdc",
